      "license": "CC BY 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "An exhibit in a glass case in the Coin Museum of the Toshakhana in Gobindgarh Fort displays some examples of early Sikh coinage. There are not actual coins, but plaster casts of them. A picture of the signage next to this exhibit which gives some detailed notes about Sikh coinage appears immediately after this. (see next picture). (Amritsar, Punjab, northern India, Nov. 2017)",
