      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "We are now in the Gobindgarh Fort grounds at last, past three gates.\nWe are greeted by a set of steep stairs, rising almost vertically onto the walls of the fort. The steps have been closed to the public by means of a shield and cross spears. Photography of that would be severely hampered by the two ladies sitting at the steps, or so I thought.\n\nThey fortunately moved off a few moments later- they had been waiting for their menfolk who were a bit behind. (Amritsar, Punjab, northern India, Nov. 2017)",
